  "title": "Asian Marinated Pork Chops",
  "description": "This Asian-inspired pork chops recipe is so quick and easy to whip up with a flavorful marinade that you can use with any meat. Dinner is served.",
  "authors": [
    "itsjustaphase"
  ],
